( IT-OV - OVERLAY PREVIX                               10-1-85)                                                                 VOCABULARY IT-VOC IMMEDIATE                                                                                                     131 OPEN-OVERLAY                                                                                                                IT-VOC DEFINITIONS                                                                                                              1600 TRANS-ALLOT                                                                                                                NEWT-DP                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( IT-OV - IFIELDS, AFIELDS                             10-1-85)                                                                   0 17  2 IFIELD: INST-VAL    68   4 3 AFIELD: SHAPE              0 19  2 IFIELD: INST-DATE   68 146 3 AFIELD: RESEMBLES         11 0  16 AFIELD: BOX-NAME                                       20 52 15 IFIELD: %NAME                                          27 0  16 AFIELD: ORIG-NAME                                      40 0  16 AFIELD: SPEC-NAME                                      43 0  16 AFIELD: BD-NAME                                        26 0  16 AFIELD: ELEM-NAME                                      26 16  2 AFIELD: ELEM-VAL                                       28 0  24 AFIELD: ART-NAME                                       28 27  2 AFIELD: ART-VAL                                        28 25  2 AFIELD: ART-VOL                                        48 11  1 IFIELD: PHR-CNT                                        48 12 254 IFIELD: PHRASE                                       ( IT-OV - CLRPAD PAD+INDENT                            10-1-85)                                                                 HEAD: CLRPAD  ( -- \ blank line buffer)                         T: PAD 1+ 38 BL FILL T;                                                                                                         HEAD: PAD+INDENT ( -- u \ pad+depth indent)                     T:  SRDEPTH 0 MAX 2* PAD + 1+ T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ( IT-OV - IDENT-BOX$ IDENT-SHIP$ IDENT-LIFE$           10-1-85)                                                                 HEAD: IDENT-BOX$ ( -- \ build box string)                       T:  ( identifier at PAD)                                          CLRPAD  ( clear line leaders) BOX-NAME PAD+INDENT 16 CMOVE T; \ HEAD: IDENT-SHIP$ ( -- \ build ship string)                   \ T:  ( identifier at PAD)                                      \  " ISS " PAD+INDENT SWAP CMOVE %NAME PAD+INDENT 4 + 15 CMOVE  \ T;                                                            \ HEAD: IDENT-RUIN$                                             \ T: @INST-SPECIES 2 MOD IF " RECENT" ELSE " ANCIENT"           \   THEN PAD+INDENT SWAP CMOVE T;                                                                                               HEAD: IDENT-LIFE$ T: RESEMBLES 1.5@ 2DUP OR 0=                    IF 2DROP SHAPE 1.5@ THEN >C+S PHRASE PHR-CNT C@                 PAD+INDENT SWAP CMOVE ICLOSE T;                               ( IT-OV - IDENT-VESSEL$ U>$                            10-1-85) EXIT                                                            \ HEAD: IDENT-VESSEL$ ( -- \ build vessel)                      \ T:  ( identifier at PAD - *** REVISE ***)                     \  CLRPAD                                                       \  " ALIEN VESSEL" PAD+INDENT SWAP                              \  CMOVE T;                                                                                                                     : U>$ ( u -- adr u \ convert single)                              ( length number to string)                                      0 <# #S #> ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  ( IT-OV - VAL,VOL>PAD                                  10-1-85)                                                                 HEAD: VAL,VOL>PAD ( val vol -- \ convert)                       T:  ( to strings and move to pad using)                           ( identifier format)                                            10 /MOD SWAP     ( 10ths & 1s )                                 U>$  DROP        ( 10ths addr -- )                              C@   PAD 32 + C! ( fraction)                                    ASCII . PAD 31 + C!  ( decimal point)                           U>$              ( 1s addr u -- )                               PAD 31 + OVER - SWAP CMOVE                                      %VAL @ U* 100 U/MOD SWAP DROP ( value adjustment)               U>$          ( adr u -- )                                       PAD 38 + OVER 1- - SWAP CMOVE T;                                                                                                                                                              ( IT-OV - IDENT-ELEMENT$ DATE$>ADR                     10-1-85)                                                                 HEAD: IDENT-ELEMENT$ ( -- \build element)                       T:  ( identifier at PAD)                                          ELEM-NAME PAD+INDENT 16 CMOVE                                   INST-QTY @ ELEM-VAL @ 10 * ( vol val)                           SWAP  VAL,VOL>PAD T;                                                                                                          : DATE$>ADR ( date adr -- \ build a )                             ( date string at adr w/o count byte)                            " 00-00-" 3 PICK SWAP CMOVE                                     SWAP 300 /MOD 4620 + ( adr rem yr --)                           U>$ 4 PICK 6 + SWAP CMOVE                                       30 /MOD 1+ U>$  ( adr day-1 adr u --)                           4 PICK 4 + OVER 1- - SWAP CMOVE                                 1+ U>$ ROT 1+ OVER 1- - SWAP CMOVE ;                          ( IT-OV - IDENT-MESSAGE$ IDENT-ARTIFACTS$              10-1-85)                                                                 HEAD: IDENT-MESSAGE$ ( -- \ build message)                      T:  ( identifier string at PAD)                                   CLRPAD        ( clear line leaders)                             INST-DATE @ PAD+INDENT DATE$>ADR                                ORIG-NAME PAD+INDENT 11 + 16 CMOVE T;                                                                                         HEAD: IDENT-ARTIFACT$ ( -- \ build relic)                       T:  ( identifier at PAD)                                          ART-NAME PAD+INDENT 24 CMOVE                                    ART-VAL @ ART-VOL @ VAL,VOL>PAD T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ( IT-OV - IDENT-SPECIMEN$ IDENT-BIO-DATA$              10-1-85)                                                                 HEAD: IDENT-SPECIMEN$ ( -- \build specimen)                     T:  ( identifier at PAD)                                          SPEC-NAME PAD+INDENT 16 CMOVE                                   INST-VAL @ INST-QTY @ VAL,VOL>PAD T;                                                                                          HEAD: IDENT-BIO-DATA$ ( --\build biodata)                       T:  ( identifier at PAD)                                          BD-NAME PAD+INDENT 16 CMOVE                                     INST-VAL @ INST-QTY @ VAL,VOL>PAD T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          